                                                "sense_id": "4e2a1d52-85e8-3516-abc4-4cf8993b1b4d",
                                                "text": "Plesner et al. reported the nonbeta islet endocrine cell remodeling in diabetic NOD mice: that study suggested that infiltrating immune cells may restrict alpha-cell expansion in NOD mouse islet in the diabetic state [ 36 ]."
